SUMMARY:PRS Database: rule starts for London (draft)
DESCRIPTION:PRS Database dates for London. Rule starts: 15 July 2027. Regis
 ter by: 14 October 2027.\n\nThe start date is in the draft Private Rente
 d Sector Database Regulations 2026. The register-by date comes from Govern
 ment guidance on the Housing Hub. We last checked both on 3 October 2026
 . The regulations were still draft then\, so the dates could change.\n\nCh
 eck before you rely on these dates.\nGuide: https://innovatedigi.github.io
 /landlord-tracker/guides/prs-database-london/\nOfficial page: https://hous
 inghub.campaign.gov.uk/renting-is-changing/get-ready-to-register/\n\nThi
 s is general information\, not legal advice. Innovate Digital is an indepe
 ndent business and is not affiliated with Innovate UK or UKRI.
